<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post5515429639696594061..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: &quot;Combatant Children&quot;</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5515429639696594061/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/combatant-children.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>11</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2668372548681060286</id><published>2014-06-10T11:13:40.217-06:00</published><updated>2014-06-10T11:13:40.217-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Fabulous post as always Mr. Grigg, and I must comm...</title><content type='html'>Fabulous post as always Mr. Grigg, and I must commend you for freeing from the rotten cesspool known as the modern state-controlled media. The problem that you so eloquently  pointed out is that people (namely gubmint &amp;quot;officials&amp;quot;) get away with these kinds of atrocities on innocent people because they are held completely unaccountable for their actions. It&amp;#39;s despicable really that people can lie, rob, rape, and murder without facing any consequences by virtue of having &amp;quot;qualified immunity.&amp;quot; It makes me wonder if all officials are sociopaths, or if it&amp;#39;s just the institution that enables the complete disregard for us mere mundanes. &lt;br /&gt;Either way it makes me sick, and the real irony is that voting won&amp;#39;t make any difference because politicians regardless of whether they be Democrats or Republicans are only interested in advancing the system and don&amp;#39;t give a flying frick about us mortals. The way I see it the only way to rectify this situation is for people to either vote for a Libertarian or not vote at all. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5515429639696594061/comments/default/2668372548681060286'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5515429639696594061/comments/default/2668372548681060286'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/combatant-children.html?showComment=1402420420217#c2668372548681060286' title=''/><author><name>Sarah</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/combatant-children.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5515429639696594061' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5515429639696594061' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1972479112"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 10, 2014 at 11:13 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2010176109132559322</id><published>2014-05-17T12:03:11.931-06:00</published><updated>2014-05-17T12:03:11.931-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;This article proves that the USGOV and its f...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;This article proves that the USGOV and its forebears have been comitting brutal atrocities and lying about them from the moment the white man set foot on this continent.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Well, I don&amp;#39;t know if this proves that, but certainly some men have been abusing others throughout history, whether the perpetrators and their victims or white, brown, purple or green.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The problem lies in the hearts of people who seek to intimidate, control or destroy others, for whatever reason.  The concept of loving your neighbor, and even your enemy, is still not fully implemented, and unfortunately doesn&amp;#39;t look to be any time soon.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;War is Peace;  Freedom is Slavery;  Ignorance is Strength&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5515429639696594061/comments/default/2010176109132559322'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5515429639696594061/comments/default/2010176109132559322'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/combatant-children.html?showComment=1400349791931#c2010176109132559322' title=''/><author><name>Winston Smith</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/combatant-children.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5515429639696594061' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5515429639696594061' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-464506630"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 17, 2014 at 12:03 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7903617226773007936</id><published>2014-05-17T12:01:29.051-06:00</published><updated>2014-05-17T12:01:29.051-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I recommend the book &amp;quot;What I Believe&amp;quot; by...</title><content type='html'>I recommend the book &amp;quot;What I Believe&amp;quot; by Leo Tolstoy.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5515429639696594061/comments/default/7903617226773007936'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5515429639696594061/comments/default/7903617226773007936'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/combatant-children.html?showComment=1400349689051#c7903617226773007936' title=''/><author><name>Jesse Porter</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/04967164496769837358</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//lh4.googleusercontent.com/-Ew8aIhXHTmw/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAB0/5qLk6LDPvoQ/s512-c/photo.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/combatant-children.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5515429639696594061' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5515429639696594061' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1370981373"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 17, 2014 at 12:01 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6424934117572192048</id><published>2014-05-17T09:16:07.951-06:00</published><updated>2014-05-17T09:16:07.951-06:00</updated><title type='text'>This article proves that the USGOV and its forebea...</title><content type='html'>This article proves that the USGOV and its forebears have been comitting brutal atrocities and lying about them from the moment the white man set foot on this continent. What has changed is the existence of the Internet, so that now the lies can be exposed for those who want to see and hear. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Mainstream media either do as they are told, or voluntarily serve the corporate agenda. 147 corporations run the world, and are duly served by the media and by every government worker, whether they know it or not. Anything you and I or our children own, including our very lives, are considered to be the property of the State, as the caretaker-administrator for those corporations. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;This concentrated global oligarchy is a new thing, but the brutality of the USGOV and its servants has always been there. The USGOV selects its enforcers for their brutality, encourages their brutality, and trains them to be even more brutal than they naturally are.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It is pointless to even try to list the atrocities and lies of this government. They are so many, we could never possibly finish cataloging them. Someone mentioned the horrible deaths of the &amp;quot;combatant children&amp;quot; in the Waco massacre? How about Madeleine Albright saying the deaths of HALF A MILLION Iraqi children from poisoned water and hunger under the Clinton sanctions on Iraq was &amp;quot;worth it&amp;quot;??? Search for it on YouTube and you will see her say so with your own eyes. Mr. Grigg only touches the tip of a vast, cold and cruel iceberg.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;All we can do is create our own little piece of sanity and compassion around us, wherever we happen to be. It is NOT a waste of time. Just as brutality passes on and on from person to person, kindness does the same. Let&amp;#39;s give it a try.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5515429639696594061/comments/default/6424934117572192048'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5515429639696594061/comments/default/6424934117572192048'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/combatant-children.html?showComment=1400339767951#c6424934117572192048' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/combatant-children.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5515429639696594061' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5515429639696594061' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1438931946"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 17, 2014 at 9:16 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8000625101621178000</id><published>2014-05-16T19:26:08.990-06:00</published><updated>2014-05-16T19:26:08.990-06:00</updated><title type='text'>A Google search for &amp;quot;Pro Libertate&amp;quot; give...</title><content type='html'>A Google search for &amp;quot;Pro Libertate&amp;quot; gives a very strange result.  It points to freedominourtime.blogspot.com but gives the author as Melinda Pillsbury-Foster.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Just wanted to let you know about the strangeness.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;- Kevin Moore kcmoore@hiwaay.net</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5515429639696594061/comments/default/8000625101621178000'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5515429639696594061/comments/default/8000625101621178000'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/combatant-children.html?showComment=1400289968990#c8000625101621178000' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/combatant-children.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5515429639696594061' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5515429639696594061' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1787651685"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 16, 2014 at 7:26 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2041963526403298193</id><published>2014-05-16T13:54:36.793-06:00</published><updated>2014-05-16T13:54:36.793-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr. Fields -- here are some recent essays I&amp;#39;ve...</title><content type='html'>Mr. Fields -- here are some recent essays I&amp;#39;ve written on the drone warfare campaign:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/10/awlaki-sanction-whos-next-on-list.html&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/07/imperial-priorities-obedience-first.html&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-massacre-sympathy-from-devil.html&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/12/send-in-drones-predator-state-goes.html</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5515429639696594061/comments/default/2041963526403298193'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5515429639696594061/comments/default/2041963526403298193'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/combatant-children.html?showComment=1400270076793#c2041963526403298193' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='18' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-bAwUsWSNJqY/Ut1X_S7xqyI/AAAAAAAAKBs/c-w-CbO5t1c/s220/New%2BProfile%2BPic.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/combatant-children.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5515429639696594061' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5515429639696594061' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 16, 2014 at 1:54 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6674129436957221560</id><published>2014-05-16T08:50:40.579-06:00</published><updated>2014-05-16T08:50:40.579-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr. Griggs,&#xa;&#xa;Have you written or can you refer me ...</title><content type='html'>Mr. Griggs,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Have you written or can you refer me to some articles/news outlets that describe a recent history of the use of drone strikes by the U.S. government?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;kollin.fields@gmail.com</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5515429639696594061/comments/default/6674129436957221560'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5515429639696594061/comments/default/6674129436957221560'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/combatant-children.html?showComment=1400251840579#c6674129436957221560' title=''/><author><name>Kollin Fields</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/08464620566000787093</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//lh4.googleusercontent.com/-KTG1xb5gLv4/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAUI/DR9RlduhFlA/s512-c/photo.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/combatant-children.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5515429639696594061' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5515429639696594061' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-802479717"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 16, 2014 at 8:50 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3382120946364569064</id><published>2014-05-15T14:52:31.821-06:00</published><updated>2014-05-15T14:52:31.821-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Here is the link on the KSL website to the story r...</title><content type='html'>Here is the link on the KSL website to the story referenced by Donna from North Dakota:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.ksl.com/?nid=148&amp;amp;sid=29787327</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5515429639696594061/comments/default/3382120946364569064'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5515429639696594061/comments/default/3382120946364569064'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/combatant-children.html?showComment=1400187151821#c3382120946364569064' title=''/><author><name>Michael</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/combatant-children.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5515429639696594061' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5515429639696594061' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1131739760"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 15, 2014 at 2:52 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3704350048900508106</id><published>2014-05-15T08:47:25.610-06:00</published><updated>2014-05-15T08:47:25.610-06:00</updated><title type='text'>So the incineration of the children(and others)at ...</title><content type='html'>So the incineration of the children(and others)at Waco in 1993 was just continuing a trend.&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt;Figures.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5515429639696594061/comments/default/3704350048900508106'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5515429639696594061/comments/default/3704350048900508106'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/combatant-children.html?showComment=1400165245610#c3704350048900508106' title=''/><author><name>Bob Gibson</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/combatant-children.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5515429639696594061' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5515429639696594061' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-680102201"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 15, 2014 at 8:47 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7133087861751992682</id><published>2014-05-14T16:01:44.594-06:00</published><updated>2014-05-14T16:01:44.594-06:00</updated><title type='text'>donna from North Dakota...&#xa;&#xa;Will, not sure how to ...</title><content type='html'>donna from North Dakota...&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Will, not sure how to email you directly so must use your &amp;#39;comment&amp;#39; section.  Today, I received an enewspaper called The Pahvant from southern Utah with another horrific story of police brutality against a sheepherder/shearer, age 64.  The original story was &amp;#39;aired&amp;#39; on KSL.  Here&amp;#39;s the link to The Pahvant story, Pablo Geronimo.    http://enewspaper.makemynewspaper.com/pahvantpost/aS33u8jSIC#.U3Pi2XbO8TA</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5515429639696594061/comments/default/7133087861751992682'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5515429639696594061/comments/default/7133087861751992682'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/combatant-children.html?showComment=1400104904594#c7133087861751992682' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/combatant-children.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5515429639696594061' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5515429639696594061' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1857826889"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 14, 2014 at 4:01 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5606646956530750149</id><published>2014-05-14T11:57:22.791-06:00</published><updated>2014-05-14T11:57:22.791-06:00</updated><title type='text'>would make you weep</title><content type='html'>would make you weep</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5515429639696594061/comments/default/5606646956530750149'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5515429639696594061/comments/default/5606646956530750149'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/combatant-children.html?showComment=1400090242791#c5606646956530750149' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/combatant-children.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5515429639696594061' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5515429639696594061' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1673523205"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 14, 2014 at 11:57 AM"/></entry></feed>